[["heading","F ULL-STACK SOFTWARE ENGINEERING · INTERVIEW PREPARATION"],["heading","09\nJavaScript in\nthe Browser"],["heading","Complete Visual Teaching Edition"],["sinhala","","Browser JavaScript සංකල්ප එකින් එක diagrams සහ code examples එක්ක ඉJගෙන ගෙනිමු.",435],["text","45 individual lessons · English + Sinhala · JavaScript · graphical explanations"],["heading","18 original topics\n4 earlier additions\n23 new additions"],["heading","How to study"],["text","Read the definition, follow the diagram, predict the output, try the code, and say the interview answer\naloud. Complete the exercise before moving on."],["sinhala","","Definition එක කියවලා diagram එJක් පියවර බලන්න. Output එක අනුමාන කරලා browser එJකන් test කරන්න. Interview answer එක තමන්Jගේ වචනවලින් කියන්න.",501],["heading","How to run the examples"],["text","Use a modern browser and DevTools Console or a local HTML page served on localhost. Snippets that refer\nto an element require matching HTML. API examples require a matching backend; worker examples require\nseparate files. Outputs are expected results, not browser-test reports. Timing, permissions, and network\nresponses can vary."],["heading","Source and scope"],["text","Original topics: Full_Stack_SE_Internship_Checklist.pdf, Section 09, p. 3. Earlier additions:\nSections_04-34_Full_Stack_Interview_Study_Guide.pdf, Section 09, pp. 18–20. New additions selected for internship\ninterviews. This is not an exhaustive Web API reference."]]